.TH NOTETOSELF 1 "@DATE@" "Note to Self @VERSION@" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
notetoself \- chat with yourself, saved as Markdown on your computer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B notetoself
.RB [ \-\-dir
.IR PATH ]
.RB [ \-\-port
.IR N ]
.RB [ \-\-browser
.IR NAME ]
.RB [ \-\-no\-open ]
.br
.B notetoself \-\-stop
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B notetoself
starts Note to Self, a chat with yourself that looks like the "Note to Self" chat in Signal
Desktop, and opens it in a browser window. Every message you send is saved as a plain
Markdown note, one file per day in a folder per chat.
.PP
It runs only on this computer: a small server on 127.0.0.1 that only answers the browser
window it opened. Press Ctrl+C, choose Quit Note to Self in the window's menu, or run
.B notetoself \-\-stop
to stop it. Running
.B notetoself
again while it's running opens another window.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-dir " PATH"
The folder for your notes (default:
.IR ~/NoteToSelf ).
It must be new, empty, or a Note to Self folder already.
.TP
.BI \-\-port " N"
The local port (default: 6683).
.TP
.BI \-\-browser " NAME"
The browser to open: chrome, chromium, edge, brave, vivaldi, firefox, safari, default (your
default browser), or the path to a browser. Without it, Note to Self uses the browser chosen
in Settings, or else an app window of Chrome, Chromium, Edge or Brave if one is installed, or
else your default browser.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-open
Start without opening a window.
.TP
.B \-\-stop
Stop the Note to Self that's running for this notes folder (the same as Quit in the window's
menu). Your notes stay where they are.
.TP
.B \-\-install\-app
Add Note to Self to your applications menu (on macOS, to your Applications folder) and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-uninstall\-app
Remove it from your applications again and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-background
Keep running in the background, as the applications menu entry does.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B NOTETOSELF_BROWSER
The browser to open when
.B \-\-browser
isn't given.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/NoteToSelf/
Everything Note to Self stores: a folder per chat with a Markdown file per day, attachments,
unsent drafts
.RI ( .draft.md ),
the trash
.RI ( .trash/ ),
and
.IR .notetoself.json ,
which marks the folder and holds the key that lets your browser open it. Settings shows the
folder, and Settings > Delete all data removes it completely.
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/human-genomics/note-to-self
